Bot name: Time Counter

Service description. The Bot tracks how much time members spend in voice channels, split into three states (unmuted, muted, deafened). It provides statistics via slash commands (/stats, /leaderboard), manual CSV exports (/export), and an automated end-of-month CSV report, after which the current month's statistics are reset.
